# Repo-root .dockerignore.
#
# The backend image (apps/backend/Dockerfile) is built with this
# directory as build context, because the npm workspace lockfile lives
# here, not under apps/backend/ — Docker only reads a .dockerignore from
# the build context's own root, so this file (not
# apps/backend/.dockerignore) is what actually governs that build. Kept
# in sync with apps/backend/.dockerignore's exclusions.

node_modules
dist
coverage
tests
*.log
logs

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.production.example

.git
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
